TI  - A Human-AI Collaborative Design Methodology for an Adolescent Smartphone Addiction Management Device: Integrating LLM-AHP, SD-LLM, and Manual Refinement
T2  - APPLIED SCIENCES-BASEL
LA  - English
KW  - smartphone addiction
KW  - anti-addiction
