TI  - Exploring the Early Adoption of Open AI among Laypeople and Technical Professionals: An Analysis of Twitter Conversations on #ChatGPT and #GPT3
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF HUMAN-COMPUTER INTERACTION
LA  - English
KW  - ChatGPT
KW  - gpt-3
KW  - twitter
KW  - structural topic modeling
