TI  - Retrieval-Augmented Question Answering on the Grain-Boundary Diffusion Literature of NdFeB Permanent Magnets: A Comparison of Commercial and Local Large Language Models
T2  - JOURNAL OF MAGNETICS
LA  - English
KW  - NdFeB
KW  - grain boundary diffusion process
KW  - coercivity
KW  - heavy rare earth
KW  - retrieval-augmented generation
