TI  - VLM-PoseManip: Dexterous robotic manipulation via Vision-Language model based instructive pose estimation for Human-Robot collaboration
T2  - ADVANCED ENGINEERING INFORMATICS
LA  - English
KW  - Intelligent manufacturing
KW  - Vision-language model
