TI  - Improving Image Captioning for Chinese Cultural Relics with Diffusion Language Models
T2  - ACM JOURNAL ON COMPUTING AND CULTURAL HERITAGE
LA  - English
KW  - Chinese Cultural Relics
KW  - Image Captioning
KW  - Diffusion Language Models
