TI  - Language model enhanced surface chloride concentration determination for concrete within splash environment based on limited field records
T2  - CASE STUDIES IN CONSTRUCTION MATERIALS
LA  - English
KW  - Concrete surface chloride concentration
KW  - Splash environment
KW  - Semantic information
