TI  - Calibrating Pre-trained Language Classifiers on LLM-generated Noisy Labels via Iterative Refinement
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 31ST ACM SIGKDD CONFERENCE ON KNOWLEDGE DISCOVERY AND DATA MINING V.2, KDD 2025
LA  - English
CP  - 31st International Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining-KDD
