TI  - Adopting Artificial Intelligence in Schools: Opportunities and Challenges in the Diffusion of a Commercial Large Language Model Across a Teaching Population
T2  - COMPUTERS IN THE SCHOOLS
LA  - English
KW  - Education
KW  - technology
KW  - artificial intelligence
KW  - TECHNOLOGY
