TI  - Generating Realistic Human Mobility Data with Hybrid Large Language Model Agent
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 32ND ACM SIGKDD CONFERENCE ON KNOWLEDGE DISCOVERY AND DATA MINING VOL 1, KDD 2026
LA  - English
