AB  - One generalization of the lattice Liouville equation (LLE) is investigated. Based on the constructed Lax pair, expressions for potential along discrete flows are calculated by using the theory of Riemann surface. Finally a new solution for the generalized LLE is obtained. It contains both exponential functions and theta functions, different from the usual ones.
