TI  - Generative AI and the Evolution of Skill Requirements in Job Postings across Labor Markets
T2  - CMC-COMPUTERS MATERIALS & CONTINUA
LA  - English
KW  - Generative-AI
KW  - labor market evolution
KW  - skill evolution
KW  - semantic framing
KW  - topic modeling
