TI  - HiFTLLM-Rail: A Hierarchical Fine-Tuned LLM for Spatio-Temporal Forecasting in Urban Railway Transit Systems
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON INTELLIGENT TRANSPORTATION SYSTEMS
LA  - English
KW  - Modeling
KW  - Forecasting
KW  - Large language models
