TI  - Copyrighting Prompts: A Path to Authentic AI or a Legal Overreach?
T2  - IIC-INTERNATIONAL REVIEW OF INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY AND COMPETITION LAW
LA  - English
KW  - Generative AI
KW  - Prompts
KW  - Copyrightability
