TI  - PromptX: A Cognitive Agent Platform with Long-term Memory
T2  - COMPANION PROCEEDINGS OF THE ACM WEB CONFERENCE 2026, WWW COMPANION 2026
LA  - English
CP  - 35th Web Conference-WWW
