TI  - Artificial Intelligence Approaches for Energy Consumption and Generation Forecasting, Anomaly Detection, and Public Decision-Making: A Systematic Review
T2  - ENERGIES
LA  - English
KW  - energy consumption forecasting
KW  - energy generation forecasting
