TI  - TGDataset: Collecting and Exploring the Largest Telegram Channels Dataset
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 31ST ACM SIGKDD CONFERENCE ON KNOWLEDGE DISCOVERY AND DATA MINING V.1, KDD 2025
LA  - English
