TI  - AMD: Anatomical Motion Diffusion with Interpretable Motion Decomposition and Fusion
T2  - THIRTY-EIGHTH AAAI CONFERENCE ON ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE, VOL 38 NO 3
