TI  - Reducing the Carbon Impact of Generative AI Inference (today and in 2035)
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 2ND ACM WORKSHOP ON SUSTAINABLE COMPUTER SYSTEMS, HOTCARBON 2023
LA  - English
CP  - 2nd ACM Workshop on Sustainable Computer Systems (ACM HotCarbon)
KW  - Generative AI
KW  - Sustainability
KW  - Carbon emissions
KW  - Large language models
