TI  - Computer Vision Meets Generative Models in Agriculture: Technological Advances, Challenges and Opportunities
T2  - APPLIED SCIENCES-BASEL
LA  - English
KW  - smart agriculture
KW  - computer vision
KW  - generative artificial intelligence
KW  - deep learning
