TI  - LLMs Generate Structurally Realistic Social Networks but Overestimate Political Homophily
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE NINETEENTH INTERNATIONAL AAAI CONFERENCE ON WEB AND SOCIAL MEDIA, VOL 19
LA  - English
CP  - 19th International AAAI Conference on Web and Social Media-ICWSM
