TI  - HyMAGE: Semantic-Aware Dynamic Hypergraph Generation
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 32ND ACM SIGKDD CONFERENCE ON KNOWLEDGE DISCOVERY AND DATA MINING V.2, KDD 2026
LA  - English
CP  - 32nd International Conference on Knowledge Discovery and Data Mining-KDD
