TI  - Generative AI for transportation safety and resilience: a comprehensive review from a lifecycle perspective
T2  - SAFETY SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - Generative AI
KW  - Transportation safety
KW  - Resilience
KW  - Lifecycle
KW  - ADVERSARIAL-NETWORK
