TI  - Risk Evolution Analysis of Cross-Regional Water Diversion Projects Based on Spatio-Temporal Knowledge Graphs
T2  - JOURNAL OF HYDROLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - Cross-regional water diversion projects
KW  - Spatio-temporal knowledge graphs
KW  - Risk evolution analysis
KW  - Complex networks
