TI  - The 3×2A framework: a profile-based interpretive approach to human-AI coevolution and adaptive governance
T2  - AI & SOCIETY
LA  - English
KW  - Generative AI
KW  - Human-AI coevolution
KW  - Socio-technical governance
KW  - Adaptive governance
KW  - Interpretive evaluation
