AB  - We introduce the MATLAB framework PARODIS, the Pareto optimal Model Predictive Control framework for distributed Systems. It is a general-purpose, flexible and easy-touse framework for discrete state space models. Special features are the support of distributed (hierarchical) systems, scenario-based optimization and built-in methods for determination of the Pareto front and selection of a solution. It uses the popular MATLAB framework YALMIP for the symbolic formulation of optimization problems and models.
