TI  - Policy learning pathways in disaster management: evolution of flood prevention systems in China's megacity
T2  - FRONTIERS IN ENVIRONMENTAL SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - emergency response goals
KW  - flood
KW  - large language models
KW  - policy learning
KW  - social network analysis
