TI  - Generative AI and the transformations of visual language: an experimental study of audiovisual production in Kuwait
T2  - FRONTIERS IN COMMUNICATION
LA  - English
KW  - algorithmic aesthetics
KW  - audiovisual media
KW  - cultural diversity
KW  - digital storytelling
