TI  - Driving Sustainability: Unravelling the Dynamics of User Engagement on Organization Generated Social Media Content on Electric Vehicles
T2  - INFORMATION SYSTEMS FRONTIERS
LA  - English
KW  - Electric vehicles
KW  - Sentiment analysis
KW  - Social media
KW  - Sustainability
