AB  - This paper presents the application of an energy consumption modeling technique using a system identification method regarding the washing program settings for a horizontal washing machine. The observer/Kalman filter identification/eigensystem realization algorithm (OKID/ERA) method is employed to identify the linear discrete state-space model by choosing the system order computed by the significant singular values. The identified model is used as an estimator to figure out the energy consumption level for washing programs with the full loading condition, and results show the feasibility of the method in energy consumption modeling.
