TI  - "Filler fatigue": media narratives, industry rhetoric, and the emergence of "filler consciousness" in aesthetic medicine
T2  - EUROPEAN JOURNAL OF PLASTIC SURGERY
LA  - English
KW  - Dermal fillers
KW  - Filler fatigue
