TI  - Conditioning continuous-time Markov processes by guiding
T2  - STOCHASTICS-AN INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF PROBABILITY AND STOCHASTIC PROCESSES
LA  - English
KW  - Markov processes
KW  - jump processes
