TI  - Variational Bayesian Monte Carlo simulation for rare event assessment
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE INSTITUTION OF MECHANICAL ENGINEERS PART O-JOURNAL OF RISK AND RELIABILITY
LA  - English
