TI  - DC Bus Stability Improvement Using Dynamic Voltage Feedback Model Predictive Control Method
T2  - JOURNAL OF ELECTRICAL ENGINEERING & TECHNOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - Motor-driven system
KW  - Dynamic voltage feedback
KW  - Model predictive control
