TI  - Continuum and thermodynamic limits for a simple random-exchange model
T2  - STOCHASTIC PROCESSES AND THEIR APPLICATIONS
LA  - English
KW  - Wealth distribution
KW  - Mean-field limits
KW  - Functional limits
