TI  - Driving Sex-Gender Equity and Ethical Integration in Edu X.0: Harnessing GenAI for Human-Centric Innovation, Responsibility, and Industry X.0 (When X.0=5.0)
T2  - 2025 IEEE GLOBAL ENGINEERING EDUCATION CONFERENCE, EDUCON
