TI  - Probabilistic indoor tracking of Bluetooth Low-Energy beacons
T2  - PERFORMANCE EVALUATION
LA  - English
KW  - Belief propagation
KW  - Bluetooth low-energy
KW  - Exact inference
KW  - Forward algorithm
KW  - Hidden Markov model
